    fneo:evidenceText "The only major world indexes that gained any value were the Hang Seng in Hong Kong, which closed up 511.51 points or 3.31%, and the Russian RTS, which partly recovered from yesterday's fall with a 10.91% increase."^^xsd:string ;
    fneo:tokenEnd "266"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
    fneo:tokenStart "265"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
    a fneo:TextualEvidence .

